# Never ship secrets into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Local PGlite dev-database data — never belongs in a production image.
# The local PGlite data directory is .dbdata, not .pgdata — the old name
# matched nothing, so an 80MB local database was being sent to the daemon
# as build context on every build.
.dbdata
**/.dbdata

.git
.github
*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# Docs and contracts are not needed at runtime.
*.md
docs/
evals/
